{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33997","headline":"奉和鲁望早秋吴体次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望早秋吴体次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书淫传癖穷欲死，譊譊何必频相仍。\n日乾阴藓厚堪剥，藤把欹松牢似绳。\n捣药香侵白袷袖，穿云润破乌纱棱。\n安得瑶池饮残酒，半醉骑下垂天鹏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}